  <metadata>
    <name>Himmelbjerget fra Ry</name>
    <desc>A loop from Ry station through the woods and up to Himmelbjerget above Julsø, south past Gammel Rye and back to Ry: 22.5 km. Roads from OpenStreetMap, routed with BRouter (fastbike); heights from EU-DEM v1.1 (25 m), which in a wood reads the tops of the trees and so lies a little high there.</desc>
